sequenceDiagram
    participant CG as Caregiver
    participant CS as Care Service API
    participant DB as Database
    participant E as Elder
    participant BS as Booking Service API
    participant NS as Notification Service

    %% Scenario 1: Caregiver creates care services
    Note over CG, DB: 1. Caregiver Creates Care Services
    CG->>CS: POST /care-services
    CS->>DB: Create care service
    DB-->>CS: Service created
    CS-->>CG: 201 Created

    %% Scenario 2: Caregiver manages care services
    Note over CG, DB: 2. Caregiver Manages Care Services
    CG->>CS: GET /care-services?caregiverId={id}
    CS->>DB: Query caregiver's services
    DB-->>CS: Return services list
    CS-->>CG: Services list
    
    CG->>CS: PATCH /care-services/{id}/status
    CS->>DB: Update service status (enable/disable)
    DB-->>CS: Status updated
    CS-->>CG: 200 Updated

    %% Scenario 3: Elder views care services
    Note over E, DB: 3. Elder Views Available Care Services
    E->>CS: GET /care-services?status=active
    CS->>DB: Query active services
    DB-->>CS: Return active services
    CS-->>E: Available services list

    %% Scenario 4: Elder books care service
    Note over E, NS: 4. Elder Books Care Service
    E->>BS: POST /bookings
    BS->>DB: Create booking
    DB-->>BS: Booking created
    BS->>NS: Notify caregiver of new booking
    NS-->>CG: New booking notification
    BS-->>E: 201 Booking created

    %% Scenario 5: Elder views own bookings
    Note over E, DB: 5. Elder Views Own Bookings
    E->>BS: GET /bookings?elderId={id}
    BS->>DB: Query elder's bookings
    DB-->>BS: Return bookings
    BS-->>E: Elder's bookings list

    %% Scenario 6: Caregiver manages bookings
    Note over CG, NS: 6. Caregiver Manages Bookings
    CG->>BS: GET /bookings?caregiverId={id}
    BS->>DB: Query caregiver's bookings
    DB-->>BS: Return bookings
    BS-->>CG: Caregiver's bookings list
    
    CG->>BS: PATCH /bookings/{id}/status
    Note right of CG: Accept or Reject
    BS->>DB: Update booking status
    DB-->>BS: Status updated
    BS->>NS: Notify elder of status change
    NS-->>E: Booking status notification
    BS-->>CG: 200 Status updated